{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55056","headline":"兵要望江南 《周易》占候第二十六（三十七首） 十四 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 《周易》占候第二十六（三十七首） 十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"占贼信，应动是（辛本、川本作「世」）爲他。\n其贼来时须（辛本、川本作「虽」）是到，到时攻我将须拿，来将丧黄沙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55056.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55056","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}